        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor: remove gateway and channel dead exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe production Knip dead-export ratchet carried 564 `src/` entries owned by gateway and channels: 316 under `src/gateway/` and 248 under `src/channels/`. Those exports enlarged internal surfaces, kept test-only seams alive, and obscured which APIs production actually consumes.\n\nRefs #105595.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Removes unused export modifiers and deletes code that existed only for dead exports.\n- Rewires tests to production-used owners or observable public behavior instead of preserving test-only exports.\n- Deletes tests that only exercised deleted implementation seams while retaining behavior coverage for reload policy, path security, watch-node permissions, rate-limit eviction, plugin-tab projection, GitHub remote parsing, and platform shell selection.\n- Preserves active loaded-target compatibility exports through their documented removal dates and marks that compatibility module as an intentional Knip entry point.\n- Keeps published Plugin SDK compatibility signatures package-safe by using emitted `.js` type-import specifiers.\n- Leaves `packages/gateway-protocol/` unchanged; versioned protocol shapes are not part of this cleanup.\n- Regenerates the shrink-only baseline from current `main`, leaving zero `src/gateway/` or `src/channels/` entries and 2,814 required entries overall.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. This narrows internal TypeScript surfaces and removes dead code while preserving gateway, channel, protocol, and active Plugin SDK compatibility contracts.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Exact-head CI: [run 29240061690](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29240061690)\n- Final `pnpm deadcode:exports:update` + `pnpm deadcode:exports`: 2,814 required entries, 0 optional entries, zero gateway/channel entries\n- `pnpm plugins:boundary-report --fail-on-eligible-compat`: 51 deprecated surfaces, 0 eligible for removal\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxdb7f6ph70f4j5f5gpeqxsq`: deadcode gate, compatibility gate, and 26 focused assertions passed\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxdcdr1dze009ynm60swnfw3` ([Actions run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29238699182)): full build passed, including Plugin SDK declaration graph and Control UI; packed-tarball import/typecheck passed from a separate consumer project\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxddcvb12yp93fw4sgag3e2f` ([Actions run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29239791735)): focused CI regression proof passed 10 tests and the 209-wildcard Plugin SDK surface budget\n- Earlier focused gateway suite: 33 files, 989 tests passed\n- Earlier broad changed suite: 5,988 passed, 16 skipped\n- Fresh Autoreview after the package-contract repair: no accepted/actionable findings, correctness 0.98\n- `git diff --check`: passed\n",
